  "description": "“I’ll do my best. When I’m with you, oppa.”\n\n“Oppa… I really don’t have the courage, but…”\n“What is it? Just say it.”\n“Would you sleep with me?”\n\nIs it okay to make such a request to my friend’s older brother?\nBut… if not today, if it’s not Jang Tae-gyeom…\n\n“I’ll do my best. When I’m with you, oppa.”\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \nR19: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12561157), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/3075001886), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/lainey_58), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/chingu_oppa_attack), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000072332), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/67660376), [Toomics](https://www.toomics.com/webtoon/episode/toon/8840)    \nR15: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12561666), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/3075001903), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/lainey_59), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/chingu_oppa_attack_15), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000078711), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/67660284) \n\n**Official Translations:**  \nR19: [French](https://www.webtoons.com/fr/romance/my-friends-oppas-attack/list?title_no=9002)",
